    "RowId": 17300,
    "Text": "Configuration Sharing"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17301,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17302,
    "Text": "This feature gives you the option to upload the hotbar and configuration settings of your currently logged-in character to the server as temporary save data. You will then be able to download and apply these settings to another character, e.g., the premade characters one might use at a convention, allowing you to play anywhere with your usual preferences."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17303,
    "Text": "If you wish to perform regular backups of your game settings, please use the server backup function found on the Character Select screen."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17304,
    "Text": "Confirm Shared Data"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17305,
    "Text": "Upload Settings"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17306,
    "Text": "Download/Apply Settings"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17307,
    "Text": "Open the server backup section of the game manual."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17308,
    "Text": "Confirm shared data details and share code."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17309,
    "Text": "Upload your current character settings and save as shared data."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17310,
    "Text": "Download shared data and apply settings to your current character."
  },
