  {
    "RowId": 17315,
    "Text": "Shared Data Details"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17316,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17317,
    "Text": "This window displays the details of your current character's uploaded configuration settings. Here you can check the code used to access this shared data, as well as the comment entered at the time of upload.\nPlease note the date and time when your saved data will expire.\n※Shared data you have uploaded will not display your character name to other players."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 17318,
    "Text": "You can also use the Companion App to confirm shared data and share code details, as well as extend the expiry date for saved data."
  },
